    ('system-design', 'Five requests to render one screen', 'Add one aggregated endpoint, such as GraphQL or a BFF, returning just what the screen needs', 'Expose one aggregated query (e.g. GraphQL or a backend-for-frontend) returning exactly what the screen needs'),
